{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55038","headline":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军梦，梦得大鱼形。\n若得小鱼军（京本作「兵」）小胜，电光霹雳主军鸣（辛本、川本、京本作「惊」），此象最爲灵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}